{"scope":"knowledge","page":7,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c490f037c1c9","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"项目级试跑与生产反馈校准","description":"校准只消费创作者提供或授权形成的**文字观察记录**，用来改进当前项目的提示词与镜头设计。 本技能不提交任务、不下载或生成媒体，也不从“任务成功”、结果地址或文件存在推断内容质量。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/project-calibration.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c5ca39c36eaa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"道具 Plate：尺度、功能、状态与文字","description":"道具 Plate 保持尺度、形状、材质、磨损、功能/活动部件与 accepted text policy。 它应展示当前 State，但不能悄悄重新设计底层 prop identity。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/prop-plate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c7eb7a3f0823","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Adapter Contract","description":"```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"job_id\": \"EP001-MOTION001-video\", \"modality\": \"video\", \"adapter\": \"studio-video\", \"prompt\": \"the exact copyable prompt from MOTION-EP001-001\", \"source\": \"剧集/EP001/视频提示词.md\", \"source_entry\": \"MOTION-EP001…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-produce/references/adapter-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-produce","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c95fe71dad72","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"前提装置：把外来优势写成有边界的压力","description":"前提装置是叠加在题材之上的一个开局设定：主角比处境中的其他人**多拥有一样东西**—— 一段已经发生过的记忆，或一套外部授权的能力。装置本身不提供冲突，它**取消**冲突； 所以它带来的全部工艺问题都是同一个：把取消掉的阻力用什么补回来。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/premise-devices.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-caa369807012","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"生产参考板决策：角色、场景与道具","description":"来自对角色、场景、物品资产如何进入后续镜头的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。 通用方法见 [common-recipe.md](common-recipe.md)；本文档提供可按项目调整的生产版式。 核心原则：**先明确资产负责的稳定身份与当前版本，再让分镜负责本镜呈现**。纯白底、 无情绪、三视图只是便于识别的一种项目选择；带环境的背景、单视图或带状态的参考板 只要更符合复用目的且不混淆身份与临时状态，也可以由创作者选择（IMG-03/IMG-04）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/production-sheet-recipes.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-cc316354f84b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧分集与单集设计","description":"1. 分集的工作定义 2. 规则分级 3. 单集契约 4. 钩子、兑现与出去的压力 5. 因果节拍与升级链 6. 场景化之前的可见性检查 7. 系列弧线与分集地图 8. 集间状态交接 9. 扩写、压缩与重排 10. 合成示例 11. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/episode-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-cfdc77d619e2","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"开篇黄金法则","description":"微短剧观众的注意力窗口极短。如果前5秒没有抓住他们，手指一划就流失了。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"m