ategories":["storyboard"],"name":"权属与版权投诉","description":"来源：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/rights.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-e6492fbe0fe4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"开篇黄金法则","description":"微短剧观众的注意力窗口极短。如果前5秒没有抓住他们，手指一划就流失了。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/opening-rules.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ea7bb7d2d226","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"钩子设计手册","description":"观众看完一集，手指悬在屏幕上——划走还是继续？这个决定在最后10秒做出。钩子的作用就是让那根手指\"划不动\"。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/hook-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ecc8be4caed4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"中文短剧 Markdown 剧本格式","description":"1. 设计目标与事实所有权 2. 文件、集与场景结构 3. 动作、对白与生产标签 4. 注释与未知内容 5. 完整格式示例 6. 稳定 ID、临时索引与修订 7. 现有文本的规范化入口 8. 剧本中不应出现的内容 9. 完成前检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/screenplay-format.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-eeee9c363ad8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"音乐 Prompt 工程指南","description":"为 Music API 构建高质量 prompt 的参考词汇表。Prompt 应使用英文。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/music-prompt-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-efb6d598bb1c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"生产分镜工艺：把剧本事实编成可审查镜头","description":"来自对剧本拍、分镜、关键帧与视频提示词如何衔接的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。 方法论见 [shot-craft.md](shot-craft.md) 与 [keyframe-craft.md](keyframe-craft.md)； 本文档是生产端的转换规则和判断依据。出现的数字只有被创作者纳入项目方案 （`craft_default`）后才是验收条件，不能只因偏离示例就判为问题。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/production-shot-grammar.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f1867706e7ef","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"审查阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有审查结论与修订要求，不改写 owner 来源。需要落盘时使用创作者可读 Markdown，引用当前 文件名、标题 ID、行号或短引文；不建立 JSON/JSONL、来源快照、哈希或接受状态。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f6528b43ea39","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"把视觉方向翻译成制作形态","description":"视觉风格不是贴在提示词前面的标签。先把创作者已接受的 `visual_direction` 和 `production_profile` 拆成可观察、可复核的选择，再让各负责人只投影本阶段需要的部分。 同一故事事实可以有多种制作形态；这里给的是提问维度、构成差异和责任边界，不是固定风格套餐。 逐形态的执行细节放在 `references/form-cards/` 的六张卡里，本文只负责怎么选、 提示词构成随形态改变什么、以及各阶段拿走什么。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/production-form-profiles.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f7a14f026d4a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"爽点与反派（satisfaction & villain）——治「没爽点 / 反派工具人」","description":"> 短剧的引擎是**情绪价值**。爽点烂 90% 是因为反派太弱、或\"越打越同级\"。写 series-bible 的爽点曲线 + 反派阶梯时读本文。 > 方法论借鉴 0xsline/short-drama（satisfaction-matrix / villain-design）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/satisfaction-and-villain.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f88d48d3654d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"故事引擎（story engine）——治「剧情简单 / 人物扁平」的根","description":"> 剧情烂的根因不是\"题材选错\"，而是**没有引擎**：事件是\"然后…然后…\"堆的、人物是被作者推着走的、反转是空降的。 > 本文给一套**因果驱动 + 人物能动**的故事引擎。**写 series-bible 前必读**；每个主要角色必须建\"行动模型\"。 > 方法论借鉴 worldwonderer/drama-skills（story-craft）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/story-engine.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}}]}
